# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of each contributor's local core.autocrlf setting -- this is a
# Node/TS/Python/Terraform/SQL backend monorepo with no reason for CRLF
# anywhere, and Linux CI runners don't rewrite line endings on checkout, so
# whatever is actually stored is exactly what CI sees.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit belt-and-suspenders for the one category where a wrong line
# ending is a hard failure, not diff noise: a CRLF shebang breaks
# immediately on Linux ("/bin/bash^M: No such file or directory").
*.sh text eol=lf

# Only real binary checked into the repo today -- keep it out of
# `* text=auto`'s heuristic entirely rather than trusting auto-detection.
*.png binary
